#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-giga-r1-wifi.rst:693
msgid ""
"The Giga R1 exposes twelve 12‑bit ADC channels on **A0–A11**, all **3.3 V "
"referenced** — ``read_u16`` returns 0–65535 across 0–3.3 V at the pin. "
"``A8``–``A11`` are analog‑only ``_C`` pads with no GPIO peripheral::"
msgstr ""
"De Giga R1 stelt twaalf 12-bits ADC-kanalen beschikbaar op **A0–A11**\\ , "
"allemaal **3,3 V-gerefereerd** — ``read_u16`` retourneert 0–65535 over 0–3,3"
" V op de pin. ``A8``\\ –\\ ``A11`` zijn alleen-analoge ``_C``\\ -pads zonder"
" GPIO-randapparaat::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-giga-r1-wifi.rst:709
msgid ""
"``A7`` is also wired to the **microphone input** on the 3.5 mm TRRS audio "
"jack — when a headset is plugged in, ``ADC(\"A7\")`` reads the analog mic "
"signal directly."
msgstr ""
"``A7`` is ook verbonden met de **microfooningang** op de 3,5 mm TRRS audio-"
"aansluiting — wanneer een headset is aangesloten, leest ``ADC(\"A7\")`` het "
"analoge microfoonsignaal rechtstreeks uit."

